# Environment Configuration

Copy this file to `.env` and fill in real values before production use.

```env
NODE_ENV=development
PORT=3000

# Database
DB_HOST=localhost
DB_PORT=5432
DB_NAME=sakina
DB_USER=sakina
DB_PASSWORD=sakina_dev_password
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://sakina:sakina_dev_password@localhost:5432/sakina?schema=public

# Redis / Valkey
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379

# NATS
NATS_URL=nats://localhost:4222

# MinIO / S3 compatible object storage
S3_ENDPOINT=http://localhost:9000
S3_ACCESS_KEY=minioadmin
S3_SECRET_KEY=minioadmin
S3_BUCKET=sakina-dev
S3_REGION=us-east-1

# Keycloak / OIDC
KEYCLOAK_URL=http://localhost:8080
KEYCLOAK_REALM=sakina
OIDC_ISSUER=http://localhost:8080/realms/sakina
OIDC_CLIENT_ID=sakina-api
OIDC_CLIENT_SECRET=replace_me

# AI model gateway
AI_PROVIDER_PRIMARY=openai
AI_PROVIDER_SECONDARY=anthropic
AI_MODEL_DEFAULT=gpt-4o-mini
AI_MODEL_SAFETY=guardrail-model

# Observability
OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT=http://localhost:4318
OTEL_SERVICE_NAME=sakina-api

# Security
JWT_SECRET=replace_me
SESSION_SECRET=replace_me
ENCRYPTION_KEY=replace_me

# Feature flags
FEATURE_VOICE=false
FEATURE_MEMORY=true
FEATURE_REFERALS=true
FEATURE_PROFESSIONAL_DIR=true
```
